<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="section__label" data-reveal>01 — About</p>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__body">
        <h2 class="section__title" data-reveal>
          I work on the hard part of <em>agentic AI</em>: knowing whether it actually worked.
        </h2>

        <div class="about__prose">
          <p data-reveal>
            At Microsoft, on GitHub Copilot, I build the evaluation machinery behind coding agents —
            a multi-axis intent taxonomy, LLM-as-judge classifiers holding 90%+ consistency per axis,
            and an outcome grader that ties offline benchmarks to what users actually experience.
          </p>
          <p data-reveal>
            That work leans on a habit of making expensive things cheap. I distilled a multi-turn
            intent classifier into a GNN that held its accuracy at roughly 2% of the original cost and
            latency, and analyzed ~100k Copilot sessions with the Office of the CTO to find where
            offline evaluation drifts from real usage.
          </p>
          <p data-reveal>
            Before that I built multimodal systems at Lily AI, and completed a MASc at the University of
            British Columbia on video diffusion models for echocardiogram generation — co-supervised by
            <a href="https://lrjconan.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Renjie Liao</a>
            and
            <a href="https://ece.ubc.ca/purang-abolmaesumi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Prof. Purang Abolmaesumi</a>, with work published at MICCAI and at workshops
            associated with CVPR and ICCV.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="stats">
          <li class="stat" data-reveal>
            <span class="stat__num" data-count="6">0</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Years in ML</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stat" data-reveal>
            <span class="stat__num" data-count="100" data-count-suffix="k">0</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Copilot sessions analyzed</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stat" data-reveal>
            <span class="stat__num" data-count="140" data-count-suffix="×">0</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Faster video generation</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="about__portrait" data-parallax="0.12">
